OL,3,GNEWSARecovery driver sentenced after
OL,4,Arunaway car crush
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vehicle recovery driver has been
OL,7,Fsentenced after he failed to secure a
OL,8,FRange Rover that later rolled down a
OL,9,Fhill, dragging him along and crushing a
OL,10,Fmember of the public who tried to help.
OL,12,FSean Baker, a driver for GRS Recovery
OL,13,FBournemouth, was sentenced to 14 weeks
OL,14,Fin prison, suspended for one year, at
OL,15,FBournemouth Crown Court on Friday.
OL,17,FCCTV showed the two-tonne vehicle
OL,18,Frolling down Exeter Crescent during a
OL,19,Frecovery operation on 22 March 2024,
OL,20,Fwith Baker caught by a rear wheel.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
